        "approval_date": "2020-01-15",
        "description": {
          "text": "Fulfilled postmarketing requirement with Study CSOM230B2219 on managing Signifor-induced hyperglycemia and updated section 6 of labeling",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for the POSTMARKETING REQUIREMENT 1985-3: \"A multi-center, randomized, clinical trial investigating the management of Signifor (pasireotide)-induced hyperglycemia in patients with Cushing's disease treated with Signifor\", as stated in the approval letter dated December 14, 2012. The final report for Study CSOM230B2219 was included in this submission, and corresponding changes to section 6 of the package insert have been proposed.",
              "doc_id": "a3df313a-28a8-5138-b1bc-5e28dae891d1",
